# Keeps the published dist archive to what a consumer actually installs. This
# package lands in other people's production trees, and their vendor directory
# is not the place for our test suite or our linter config.
#
# Affects `composer archive` and dist downloads only — a clone of the mirror
# still carries everything, because a client that cannot be tested standing
# alone is not a client anyone can release (docs/ingest-clients.md §12).
/tests            export-ignore
/phpunit.xml      export-ignore
/phpstan.neon     export-ignore
/pint.json        export-ignore
/.gitattributes   export-ignore
